    "updated_at": "2025-06-12T11:00:36Z",
    "body": "Using `XMLDocument` here seems like clearly the right thing. Fixing everything around the document interfaces at once is a big lift, but maybe the spec could be updated to acknowledge that `XMLDocument` is real (not an alias) and this specific creation site is fixed?",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
